# Personal Portfolio Website

A simple and professional personal portfolio website built using **HTML and CSS**. The website showcases personal information, skills, projects, education, and contact details.

## Features

* Clean and professional design
* About Me section
* Skills section
* Projects section
* Education section
* Contact section
* Responsive layout

## Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3

## How to Run

1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Open `index.html` in any web browser.

## Purpose

This project was created to practice HTML and CSS and to build a simple professional portfolio website.

